        "TileImage": "$($repository 997d7905-1a94-48d9-b767-369afdb8a139).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening 47.\rYour target is Alex Rheinhart, the president of the &apos;Worlds Sport Federation&apos;, who is currently visiting Don Yates retirement party. Rheinhart controls the organisation, so he needs to be taken down, to prevent the influence of &apos;Providence&apos; from spreading into the world of sports. Our client, the &apos;Private Militia&apos;, have kept an eye on him from many years, ordering his elimination today. \rEliminate the target, avoiding all collateral damages.\rGood luck 47.\rMission ststuas: ACTIVE",
